  <!-- One staff, five quarter notes: C4 D4 E4 E4 F4. In Practice: C4 accepted (green), D4 skipped (grey), the first E4
       pressed and held (accepted) so the second E4 arrives with its key already down (held over), and a further key
       held at the same time (a red disc). Shows the four Practice marks in one picture (feature 008, US3, SC-005). -->
